      "body": "Confirmed compatibility report submitted: https://github.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/pull/8\n\n- **Status:** boots\n- **Release:** v0.1.6\n- **Device:** OnePlus 13 · Snapdragon 8 Elite\n- **Driver:** Mesa Turnip 26.2.0-devel (git-7fdde2f8f8) — Turnip gen8 v2 (JICA98/bachata-s4-drivers)\n- **Evidence commit:** `ce9e6cf9ea65ca31d0e20f80af2554ebbb80e112`\n\nGalak-Z boots and renders frames but stays on a static dark boot frame; the title screen never appears (not playable). FIOS-HLE reports missing Unity assets (resources.assets.resS).\n\n### Screenshots\n\n![Galak-Z — v0.1.6 — boots](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/ce9e6cf9ea65ca31d0e20f80af2554ebbb80e112/assets/CUSA03146/20260802T114817Z-v0-1-6-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-mesa-turnip-26-2-0-devel/screenshots/01.webp)\n\n![Galak-Z — v0.1.6 — boots](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/ce9e6cf9ea65ca31d0e20f80af2554ebbb80e112/assets/CUSA03146/20260802T114817Z-v0-1-6-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-mesa-turnip-26-2-0-devel/screenshots/02.webp)\n",
